{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_11\">Problem 11</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 11\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The three sides of a right triangle have integral lengths which form an arithmetic progression. One of the sides could have length\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/4/7c43d4d304b505c13f442016a8a4497172a973c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 22\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 58\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 81\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 91\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 361$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"402\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the three sides be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/0/730a04d09740e0b0f50d1140c614f6e7840e9bbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b83c9c3a8da8388f2c9107e68f8fe59683cd0cdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" />.  By the Pythagorean Theorem,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc5880d763c71647a88ec7d028568ce18e987765.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a-d)^2 + a^2 = (a+d)^2\\]\" width=\"186\" height=\"19\" />\nThis can be simplified to\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/6/b26d2bea8be942aa33b38720588172c3661f3034.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a(a-4d) = 0\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"18\" />\nwhich has solutions\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/c/e3c50e06d1c43e9e16ae064330b10a7c5cecfaa8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a = 0, a = 4d\\]\" width=\"103\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/c/69cefa6855d2216036df094012f7ad2a7e4e204f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> is invalid, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c1614ce6f04f1a4c3097ac418838522570891999.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=4d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" /> and the triangle has sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b26c8398882a95a9099c7b9516439dd6b467c65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3d$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/f/a8fba9005cb63bba4318f8b13049aa3006547cd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/7/7a7dab1b6e7f8f74319e4b848e6b0cd434c72007.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5d$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />.  Therefore, the correct answer must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The only valid answer choice is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/c/b0c887993e67b6a4530a64d5aecc30169b79f2ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 81}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" />, since it is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>-edited by coolmath34\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?